# Ignore everything
**

# Allow files and directories
!assets
!packages
!dependencies-apt.txt
!dependencies-py3.txt
!launchers

# YOUR FILES LISTED BELOW THIS LINE (IMPORTANT: PREPEND !)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT prefixed with ! -- these are re-excluded from the context that "!packages" let in.
#
# The weights do not belong in the image. They live on the robot's /data partition, put there
# once by scripts/sync_models.py; shipping them through the build context meant 77 MB over the
# robot's WiFi on every cold build, and a dropped association takes BuildKit's context stream
# with it. This is what keeps the context at ~300 KB.
packages/model_node/assets/*.onnx
